{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19685","headline":"道州途中即事 · 吕温","name":"道州途中即事","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"零桂佳山水，[荥]阳旧自同。\n经途看不暇，遇境说难穷。\n叠嶂青时合，澄湘漫处空。\n舟移明镜里，路入画屏中。\n岩壑千家接，松萝一径通。\n渔烟生缥缈，犬吠隔笼葱。\n戏鸟留余翠，幽花恡晚红。\n光翻沙濑日，香散橘园风。\n信美非吾土，分忧属贱躬。\n守愚资地僻，恤隐望年丰。\n且保心能静，那求政必工。\n课终如免戾，归养洛城东。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"吕温","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_19685.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19685","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}